    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Investigate & Modify\r\n\r\nThis garden needs two rows of flowers — the Painter should \"plant\" flowers across the top row, then drop down and \"plant\" flowers on the 3rd row. \r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\nRun the program: notice only the first row gets painted. Investigate the code to figure out why the second row never happens, then fix it.",
